What this licence covers

It covers the repository's own tools and pages: everything in tools/, site/,
docs/ and .github/.

It does NOT cover the stacks. Each folder under stacks/ belongs to the person
who shared it, under the licence named in that folder's listing.json.

The gallery plays stacks in OXT-Beyond's Stack Player, which the Publish
workflow downloads from an OXT-Beyond release (tools/pins.json). It is not
part of this repository and has its own licence, the GNU General Public
License version 3: https://github.com/SethMorrowSoftware/OpenXTalk-Beyond
